MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 09d9dd0205bab0640872e2256248d999, type: 3}
  m_Name: Sample Briefing
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _source: {fileID: 4900000, guid: c76f32fa65064a4eb23d7fa7ae1c9f68, type: 3}
  _sourcePath: Assets/Campaign/UI/Battle prep menus/Tent/Sample/Sample Briefing.md
  _warnings: []
  _lines:
  - Speaker: Jagen
    Text: My prince, the scouts are back. A bandit warband has dug in at the river
      ford, right across the merchant road.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 1
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: 
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6358ec34be7e5e149b95f25afd6fe2a3, type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  - Speaker: Prince Julian
    Text: The road that carries our grain, and our creditors' patience. How many?
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 2
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6358ec34be7e5e149b95f25afd6fe2a3, type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c91b921366b8697479105d1fc90faef5, type: 3}
  - Speaker: Jagen
    Text: Three bands of foot, a few archers in the reeds and riders on the far bank.
      Break their line and the rest will run.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 1
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6358ec34be7e5e149b95f25afd6fe2a3, type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c91b921366b8697479105d1fc90faef5, type: 3}
  - Speaker: Lyra
    Text: Mind the coffers, Highness. Borrow if you must, but every crown owed is
      prestige spent.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 2
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Lyra
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6358ec34be7e5e149b95f25afd6fe2a3, type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4379dc5e67c725f4e8556d9caab25c7b, type: 3}
  - Speaker: Prince Julian
    Text: 'Then we strike quickly. Ready the war table: no more than five companies,
      and we march at dawn.'
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 1
    LeftName: Prince Julian
    RightName: Lyra
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c91b921366b8697479105d1fc90faef5, type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4379dc5e67c725f4e8556d9caab25c7b, type: 3}
